<title>USA: Comerica Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Comerica Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.10		    $0.98</p>
<p> Net			123,772		  116,606</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 109,089		  119,161</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 net income applicable to common stock $119.5 million vs $116.6 million.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 net interest income $351.8 million vs $349.3 million.  Q1 1997 provision for loan losses $41.0 million vs $28.5 million.  </p>
<p>Q1 1997 total non-interest income $129.4 million vs $137.4 million.</p>
<p>Assets $34.87 billion vs $35.02 billion</p>
<p>Deposits $22.15 billion vs $22.91 billion</p>
<p>Net loans $26.66 billion vs $25.19 billion</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
